                  <Text>Step 1 in the split period calculation is to validate and filter out any irrelevant user input from the split period configuration tab of the main configuration spreadsheet.  This step excludes any split periods whose dates coincide with the beginning or ending fiscal year dates (invalid splits as numerate would be zero), and any splits whose dates lie out of the bounds of the fiscal year.  The final split period is added and the records are sorted.</Text>
